          <p>
            The pattern is easy to see once the rows sit together. Whey isolates cluster around 25 to 32 grams because there is little in the powder except protein. Flavored whey blends sit a little higher, around 31 to 36 grams. Plant blends run larger, with a median serving of 39 grams across the 19 we track, because pea and rice proteins are less concentrated and usually carry gums, fibers or greens. You can open any row in the <a href="/protein-powder/optimum-nutrition-gold-standard-whey/">Gold Standard Whey label page</a> format to see the full panel and source.
          </p>

