          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A scoop of protein powder is about 30 grams and usually 20 to 25 grams of protein, but your tub's Supplement Facts panel is the only number that counts. Check the serving weight, the scoop count and the protein line before you plan your day around it.
          </p>
